00:19:45.067 --> 00:19:45.967
Oke.

00:19:46.067 --> 00:19:47.376
Jadi kapan saja kamu butuh penggerak baru...

00:19:47.400 --> 00:19:48.300
Oke.

00:19:48.400 --> 00:19:49.733
Jack bisa tampil di berita,

00:19:49.833 --> 00:19:51.267
